 *
 * 12 Sept 2026: Steps upto 130 completed.
 * 17 Sept 2026: Converted abAppend(ABuf, string, length) to ABuffer::append(string, length), and related type bound functions.
 * 18 Sept 2026: Converted to use ERow:: and Editor:: type bound procedures and functions.
 * 19 Sept 2026: FINISHED!
 *)


To create (requires ../../bin/tmodc to have been built with `make tmodc` at project root.):

`make kilo`

to make kilo runtime. To compile read_key utility:

` make read_key`

to make both:

`make all`

Running `make run` will compile and execute ./kilo. To clean:

`make clean`


